kokoro-mlx-port
An MLX port of Kokoro-82M (text to speech) for Apple silicon.

Ported from hexgrad's kokoro 0.9.4 (https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro) and
the Kokoro-82M model (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M), both under
the Apache License 2.0. The ALBERT layer follows Hugging Face transformers
(Apache License 2.0). Model weights are not included in this repository; they
are exported from the official kokoro-v1_0.pth by mlx-port/export/export_weights.py.

